/-
Package initialization instances for the packages the apply thread's translation
(`server/v3/etcdserver`, `EtcdCache/Code/go_etcd_io/etcd/server/v3/etcdserver.lean`) reaches,
beyond those of `Cache/Base.lean` (protobuf, `etcdserverpb`, ...) and `Server/Base.lean`
(`cindex`, `schema`, `backend`, `verify`). Generated by a script from the translation's
`PkgInfo` imports.

As there, these are assumptions about package initialization, not proved from
`initialize'`. They are `True` (the packages are translated names-only or types-only), except
`etcdserver/errors`: `ErrNoSpace` holds a fixed non-nil error (`errors.New` at init), which
the entry applier compares the applier's error with.
-/
